ete is captured from the create-snapshot response. Teardown: snapshot-schedules/rates/replications/attachments are deleted as cleanup before the volume DELETE; volume DELETE is destructive with 409/500 retry, then poll to 404. KNOWN-BLOCKED (userguide, fetched 2026-06-10): 연결 서버 (attachments, 1..8 Bare Metal Servers) is a REQUIRED create field — attachments:[] is why create 400s (run 27258520218); the chain stays called-only until a real BM server id is available to attach (knowledge/formal/services/storage__baremetal-blockstorage.yaml).",
